namespace pdg { /**

\class pdg::AnimationSpringTarget
\ingroup Animation Physics
\brief Spring target smoothing and recoil impulses.

Keeps position and velocity independently of a Sprite. Call update() with a target
and elapsed seconds to smooth motion, or applyImpulse() to produce recoil.
getState() returns a copy; setState() replaces all position and velocity fields.

The helper does not update automatically. Apply each sample to a freshly
evaluated pose instead of adding it repeatedly to the previous final pose.

\see AnimationSpringTarget(), update(), \ref animation_target_adapters

**/ }
